<details><summary>Reveal the finite proof and its limitation</summary>

If every contribution were strictly below $\delta/q$, their sum would be strictly below $\delta$, a contradiction. This proves existence of a detectable residue after a concrete reduction supplies the contribution decomposition; it does not by itself define the oracle experiments or error-distribution argument.

{{algorithm:2}}
</details>

## 5. Synthesis

Units determine **which transformations are safe**, $\varphi(q)$ determines **how many are available**, CRT determines **how safety decomposes**, and finite averaging determines **where distinguishing advantage must remain**. Together these ideas provide the arbitrary-modulus algebraic scaffold for LWE search-to-decision analysis.
